{"seq":2,"slug":"rarity-tiers","title":"稀有度层级：两阶段抽样与稀有度设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/rarity-tiers","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"稀有度层级-两阶段抽样与稀有度设计\">稀有度层级：两阶段抽样与稀有度设计</h1><p>白、绿、蓝、紫、橙——几乎每个玩过 RPG 的人都能背出这套稀有度色阶。它不只是给物品染个色，而是一整套支撑掉落系统的<strong>两阶段抽样结构</strong>：先决定「掉什么档次」，再决定「这个档次里具体掉哪件」。这一篇讲清为什么这个结构如此普遍、它相比扁平抽样好在哪、以及稀有度配额与稀有物品保护这些让掉落「感觉对」的设计手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么要两阶段\">核心概念：为什么要两阶段</h2><p>如果把所有物品——从 1% 的橙装到 60% 的金币——铺在一张扁平表里直接加权抽样（见<a href=\"weighted-random\">加权随机</a>），理论上完全可行。但两阶段（先抽稀有度层、再抽层内物品）几乎总是更好，原因有三：<strong>独立调控</strong>（改「橙装总掉率」不必动任何具体物品权重）、<strong>结构清晰</strong>（策划按稀有度分组管理，符合直觉）、<strong>保护稀有物</strong>（避免新增一件普通物品就稀释了整层稀有物的掉率）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[掉落触发] --&gt; B[第一阶段:抽稀有度层]&#10;  B --&gt; C{命中哪一层?}&#10;  C --&gt;|82%| D[普通层 common]&#10;  C --&gt;|15%| E[稀有层 rare]&#10;  C --&gt;|2.9%| F[史诗层 epic]&#10;  C --&gt;|0.1%| G[传说层 legendary]&#10;  D --&gt; H[第二阶段:层内等/加权抽物品]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[返回具体物品]\">flowchart TD\n  A[掉落触发] --&gt; B[第一阶段:抽稀有度层]\n  B --&gt; C{命中哪一层?}\n  C --&gt;|82%| D[普通层 common]\n  C --&gt;|15%| E[稀有层 rare]\n  C --&gt;|2.9%| F[史诗层 epic]\n  C --&gt;|0.1%| G[传说层 legendary]\n  D --&gt; H[第二阶段:层内等/加权抽物品]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[返回具体物品]</pre><p>这本质上是<a href=\"../foundations/loot-model\">掉落模型</a>里嵌套表的最典型应用：第一阶段的表引用四个稀有度子表，第二阶段在子表内抽具体物品。数学上，某件传说物品的最终掉率是两阶段概率之积——设传说层掉率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>layer</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{layer}} = 0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">layer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>、该层内共 20 件等概率，则单件掉率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>item</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.001</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.00005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{item}} = 0.001 \\times \\frac{1}{20} = 0.00005</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">item</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00005</span></span></span></span></span>，即 0.005%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀有度层的概率设计\">稀有度层的概率设计</h2><p>稀有度层的概率通常不是均匀递减，而是按数量级跌落——每高一级，掉率降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/5</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/10</span></span></span></span></span>。下面是一套常见的五层配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>稀有度层</th>\n<th>典型掉率</th>\n<th>相对上一层</th>\n<th>玩家心理定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通 (白)</td>\n<td>82%</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>几乎必得，垫底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优良 (绿/蓝)</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>~1/5</td>\n<td>常见小惊喜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀有 (紫)</td>\n<td>2.9%</td>\n<td>~1/5</td>\n<td>一次值得截图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>史诗 (橙)</td>\n<td>0.09%</td>\n<td>~1/30</td>\n<td>追求目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传说 (金)</td>\n<td>0.01%</td>\n<td>~1/9</td>\n<td>炫耀资本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设计层掉率时有个实用公式：若希望玩家平均杀 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 只怪掉一件某层物品，该层掉率应设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（几何分布期望）。例如想让传说平均每 10000 只怪出一件，就把传说层设为 0.01%。但要记住几何分布方差很大——0.01% 掉率下，有约 37% 的玩家杀满 10000 只仍未出（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.0001</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>10000</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.368</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-0.0001)^{10000} \\approx e^{-1} \\approx 0.368</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0001</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10000</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.368</span></span></span></span></span>）。这个方差问题正是<a href=\"../fairness/\">公平</a>章要用 PRD 和保底去解决的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀有度配额与动态调整\">稀有度配额与动态调整</h2><p>高级掉落系统不满足于静态层掉率，会引入<strong>配额</strong>（quota）和<strong>动态调整</strong>让稀有度分布随玩家状态变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>保底配额</strong>：保证「每开 50 个宝箱至少 1 个紫色」，用一个计数器跟踪距上次紫色的间隔，达到阈值强制升级。这是<a href=\"../fairness/pity-timers\">保底机制</a>在稀有度维度的应用。</li>\n<li><strong>难度加成</strong>：高难度副本整体提高稀有层掉率（如「炼狱难度传说掉率 ×3」），实现「风险—回报」正相关。做法是给稀有层权重乘一个难度系数后再归一化。</li>\n<li><strong>首杀/限时加成</strong>：首次击杀 boss 或活动期间临时提升某层掉率，制造事件感。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>动态调整的实现要点是<strong>在归一化之前修改层权重</strong>。假设基础层权重是 <code>[common:820, rare:150, epic:29, legendary:1]</code>，炼狱难度把稀有及以上乘 3，变成 <code>[common:820, rare:450, epic:87, legendary:3]</code>，再归一化——注意普通层掉率会因总权重上升而自动下降，这正是想要的效果（好东西变多，垃圾变少）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀有物品保护-防稀释\">稀有物品保护：防稀释</h2><p>两阶段结构最重要的隐性收益，是<strong>防止稀有物被稀释</strong>。设想扁平表里有 5 件传说、95 件普通，若某天策划新增 50 件普通物品，扁平表总权重变化，每件传说的相对掉率会被动下降——这是灾难，因为策划本意只是加内容，却意外削弱了传说。</p>\n<p>两阶段彻底隔离了这个问题：传说层的<strong>层掉率</strong>是固定的 0.01%，与层内有几件、其它层加了多少物品完全无关。新增 50 件普通物品只影响「普通层内部各物品的相对权重」，传说层掉率纹丝不动。这个隔离性让内容团队能安心地持续加物品而不用担心破坏稀有度经济——它对长期运营的价值，会在<a href=\"../practice/loot-economy\">掉落与经济平衡</a>里进一步展开。</p>\n<p>层内抽物品这一步本身也有讲究：可以等概率（层内每件机会均等），也可以再加权（同层内某些物品更稀有）。当层内物品很多且抽样频繁时，层内抽样可以用<a href=\"alias-method\">别名法</a>加速到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稀有度层是「先抽档次、再抽层内物品」的两阶段抽样，是嵌套表最典型的应用。</li>\n<li>两阶段相比扁平表的三大优势：独立调控层掉率、结构清晰、保护稀有物防稀释。</li>\n<li>单件最终掉率是两阶段概率之积；层掉率按数量级跌落，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 可让平均每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次出一件，但几何分布方差大。</li>\n<li>配额、难度加成、限时加成等动态调整都应在归一化前修改层权重；防稀释是两阶段最重要的隐性收益。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/loot-model\">掉落模型</a> —— 稀有度层背后的嵌套表结构。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../fairness/pity-timers\">保底机制</a> —— 稀有度配额的方差控制版本。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"alias-method\">别名法与高效抽样</a> —— 层内海量物品的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 抽样。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/procedural-itemization\">库存与物品化 · 程序化物品生成</a> —— 稀有度如何影响词缀与属性生成。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稀有度层级：两阶段抽样与稀有度设计","id":"稀有度层级-两阶段抽样与稀有度设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么要两阶段","id":"核心概念-为什么要两阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"稀有度层的概率设计","id":"稀有度层的概率设计"},{"level":2,"text":"稀有度配额与动态调整","id":"稀有度配额与动态调整"},{"level":2,"text":"稀有物品保护：防稀释","id":"稀有物品保护-防稀释"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"加权随机：从权重到概率的抽样算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/weighted-random"},"next":{"title":"别名法与高效抽样：O(1) 采样的构建与技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/alias-method"}}